WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.900
Vur wã yel-solemdã. B sẽn yeelã yaa: "Neb nins b sẽn maandã, b maana wa b sẽn da tẽedã".

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.386
Tẽng a yembr pʋgẽ, ned fãa mii a to. La ned kam fãa tagsdame t'a mii bũmb fãa yẽ mengã zugu.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.552
Pʋg-kõorã sẽn yaa pʋg-paalã kogla a roogẽ bõn-buud fãa.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.792
Zĩ-kãnga yʋngo, sobg n kẽe a zakẽ wã, la b zãag ne kood roogã.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.890
Vẽkembeoogo, a Ebéyé bãngame tɩ b zãmb-a lame. Tẽngã tigimdame.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.122
Kɩɩmb n wat be. B yãee ned ning sẽn maan-a yel-wẽnã.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.374
Yaa yẽ! Yaa yẽ bal n tõe n maan woto!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.600
Baa a sã n kɩɩsda, ned baa a yen pa kelg-a ye.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.848
Ned sã n pa tar kaset, a ka tõe n kao ned bʋʋd ye.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:44.138
Kãsem dãmbã tigimdame. Ned pa yã bũmb ye, tɩ ned kam fãa tagsd a to yelle.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.608
B yãka yam n na n bas-a lame.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.314
B kẽnga tẽn-kʋdgã zĩigẽ. D pa na n le togs bũmb a to ye.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.688
La b ka tõe n wilg bũmb ye, yaa sobg bala, vẽenem la lik bala.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.504
Vʋʋsem a yiib-n-soabã, bi-bɩɩg a ye ra pa tol n gõe ye.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.586
A rɩka koodã. La rabeemã la a sũur sãamame.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:17.034
Daar a ye yʋngo, a wʋka sakã n bĩng koglgã tẽngre. La a Ebéyé beeme.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.682
Yaa maam. Bas-y maam, m pa le tõe n maan woto ye.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:31.126
Yaa maam n yibe. Pa pe-kɩɩmã ye.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.306
Fo meng n yeel-a lame. Woto yaa sõma.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.320
B kosa pe-kɩɩmã sugri, t'a lebg n kẽng a sorẽ.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.560
Ned sã n wa soog pʋg-kõor pʋʋgẽ,

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:12.362
B yetame t'a na n yɩɩ nin-buiida. Wakat ninga, nebã ra bãngda sɩdã.
